1
00:00:00,469 --> 00:00:01,849
(Howard:)What now?

2
00:00:02,971 --> 00:00:04,011
(Sheldon:)I have to go to the bathroom.

3
00:00:04,173 --> 00:00:05,383
(Howard:)You just went to the bathroom.

4
00:00:05,541 --> 00:00:07,921
(Sheldon:)I didn't use it because
it didn't seem safe.

5
00:00:09,078 --> 00:00:11,748
(Sheldon:)Despite all my emails,
the toilet didn't have a seatbelt.

6
00:00:14,350 --> 00:00:15,830
(Howard:)Well, it still doesn't.

7
00:00:15,984 --> 00:00:17,154
(Sheldon:)I realize that,

8
00:00:17,319 --> 00:00:20,489
(Sheldon:)but safety concerns went out
the window two apple juices ago.

9
00:00:22,057 --> 00:00:23,437
(Sheldon:)Fine.

10
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:26,330
(Sheldon:)Why are you getting annoyed?

11
00:00:26,495 --> 00:00:28,775
(Howard:)I'm trying to be a better friend,

12
00:00:28,931 --> 00:00:32,941
(Howard:)but you constantly say
and do irritating things.

13
00:00:33,102 --> 00:00:34,702
(Sheldon:)-Like when?
-When?

14
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:38,110
(Howard:)How about in the car?
I'm an astronaut, and you know it.

15
00:00:38,273 --> 00:00:41,253
(Howard:)You just don't like admitting it,
because you're jealous.

16
00:00:43,912 --> 00:00:46,752
(Sheldon:)Well, truth be told,

17
00:00:46,915 --> 00:00:49,395
(Sheldon:)as a child,
I did dream of going to space.

18
00:00:49,551 --> 00:00:51,551
(Sheldon:)Those astronauts were my heroes.

19
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:56,030
(Sheldon:)And when you got to go,
it was hard for me.

20
00:00:58,927 --> 00:01:00,097
(Raj:)Thank you.

